  { label: 'The heart of town', value: 'Washington Avenue downtown — galleries, restaurants, a bookstore, a couple of bars, and the Saturday farmer’s market. It runs from the harbor up past the railroad tracks. If you base yourself near here, you can walk to most of the good stuff.' },
