        <li>City of Ocean Springs — Golf Carts (Ch. 14, Art. V) — <a href="https://oceansprings-ms.gov/284/Golf-Carts" target="_blank" rel="noopener">oceansprings-ms.gov/284/Golf-Carts</a></li>
